    "q-130633": {
      "dom_id": "step-q130633",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "What is the minor of ${x}_{12}$ in \n$X=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 3 & 3 & 11 & 7 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & 1 & -8 & 8 \\\\ -6 & 4 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]?$",
      "worked_solution": "To get the minor of ${x}_{12}$, we remove the $1$st row and $2$nd column:\n\n$$\nX=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & 0 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ 3 & ∗ & 11 & 7 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & ∗ & -8 & 8 \\\\ -6 & ∗ & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{12}=|\\begin{aligned}3 & 11 & 7 \\\\ \\sqrt{2} & -8 & 8 \\\\ -6 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
