    "q-130803": {
      "dom_id": "step-q130803",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Find the minor of  ${e}_{14}$ in  $E=[\\begin{aligned}3 & \\sqrt{5} & 5 & 8 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & -1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 3 & 8 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 3 & 4 & 2 & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}].$",
      "worked_solution": "To get the minor of ${e}_{14}$, we remove the $1$st row and $4$th column:\n\n$$\nE=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & ∗ & 8 & ∗ \\\\ 1 & 3 & -7 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & -1 & ∗ & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 3 & ∗ & 0 \\\\ 7 & 3 & 4 & ∗ & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, the minor is\n\n$$\n{M}_{14}=|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 22 & 5 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 7 & 3 & 4 & \\frac{5}{2}\\end{aligned}|.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
