    "q-32798": {
      "dom_id": "step-q32798",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "What is the minor of ${f}_{13}$ in  $F=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 & 5 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 2 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 8 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -5 & 2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 3 & 11 & 2\\end{aligned}]?$",
      "worked_solution": "To get the minor of ${f}_{13}$, we remove the $1$st row and $3$rd column:\n\n$$\nF=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & 5 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ 0 & 7 & ∗ & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & ∗ & 4 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -5 & ∗ & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & ∗ & 11 & 2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n   \n\nSo, the minor is\n\n$$\n{M}_{13}=|\\begin{aligned}0 & 7 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 2 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 5 & -5 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 4 & 11 & 2\\end{aligned}|.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-32798-a",
