    "q-36091": {
      "dom_id": "step-q36091",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "Find the minor of  ${e}_{15}$ in  $E=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 0 & -3 & 8 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -7 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 11 & 5 & 4 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0 & 8 & 0 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -6 & 0 & 7\\end{aligned}].$",
      "worked_solution": "To get the minor of ${e}_{15}$, we remove the $1$st row and $5$th column:\n\n$$\nE=[\\begin{aligned}∗ & ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & 5 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -7 & 0 & ∗ \\\\ 11 & 5 & 4 & 3 & ∗ \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0 & 8 & ∗ \\\\ 5 & 3 & -6 & 0 & ∗\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nSo, the minor is\n\n$$\n{M}_{15}=|\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -7 & 0 \\\\ 11 & 5 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -6 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\n$$",
