    "q-32800": {
      "dom_id": "step-q32800",
      "name": "Question 13",
      "problem": "Calculate the determinant of the matrix\n$A=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}]$",
      "worked_solution": "We use the cofactor expansion along the first row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & ={a}_{11}{C}_{11}+{a}_{12}{C}_{12}+{a}_{13}{C}_{13}+{a}_{14}{C}_{14} \\\\  & =0\\cdot {C}_{11}+8\\cdot {C}_{12}+0\\cdot {C}_{13}+0\\cdot {C}_{14} \\\\  & =8{C}_{12} \\\\  & =8\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}∗ & 8 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ -1 & ∗ & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & ∗ & 6 & 2 \\\\ 1 & ∗ & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =8(-1)^{1+2}|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 6 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-8((-1)\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}6 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|-0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|+0\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}3 & 6 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|) \\\\  & =8(6\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 2)-0+0 \\\\  & =8\\cdot 14 \\\\  & =112\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
